# Bundle artifacts
*.jsbundle

# Variant-specific manifest sources must stay committed. A bare `release`
# pattern in the user's global gitignore (~/.gitignore) matches this directory
# by name, which would silently drop app/src/release/AndroidManifest.xml from
# the repo and therefore from EAS builds. Re-include it explicitly: the
# directory has to be un-excluded before a file inside it can be.
!app/src/release/
!app/src/release/AndroidManifest.xml
